# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository *and* in every checkout.
#
# This repo has no binaries, so a blanket rule is safe. It matters because:
#   * `lib/client.js` is a vendored bundle compared byte-for-byte against the
#     freshly vendored output (`npm run vendor:check`), and the offline suite
#     asserts on literal source text such as `window.__ModuleLoader__.load({`;
#   * a Windows checkout with the common `core.autocrlf=true` would otherwise
#     rewrite all 1255 line endings and fail both of those guards.
* text=auto eol=lf
